	(text "GERBANG S5 — TVS: D10 SM712 (SOT-23, Littelfuse) SATU device dua jalur:\n  A1->RS485_A, A2->RS485_B, common->DGND — asimetris -7V/+12V = range\n  common-mode RS-485 (600W). Terpasang DEKAT J_RS485 (S9: <10 mm).\nTERMINASI: R48 120R 1% + JP_RS485_TERM (solder-jumper 2-pin OPEN default\n  = terminasi OFF; tutup dgn solder = 0R ON) — bus pendek indoor\n  (<10 m) tanpa terminasi; aktifkan HANYA bila kabel panjang/refleksi.\nBIAS OPSIONAL (DN-S5-05): fail-safe bias 2x680R — R51 (+3V3->A) & R52\n  (B->DGND), masing-masing lewat jumper pemilih JP_RS485_BIAS_A/B\n  (default OPEN = bias off). Aktifkan KEDUA jumper BERSAMA terminasi:\n  V_AB idle = 3,3 x 120/(680+120+680) = +0,27 V > +0,2 V threshold\n  (RO deterministik saat bus float/semua node idle)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 145 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33fd25ec-08d9-453a-a4c5-cf2ee3fba5be")	)
	(text "U8 MAX3485CSA+ (SOIC-8, 3,3V, 10 Mbps slew-limited — 32 node):\n  pin 1=RO  2=/RE  3=DE  4=DI  5=GND  6=A  7=B  8=VCC (datasheet Maxim\n  MAX3483-3491; simbol KiCad di-flatten dari LTC2850xS8 — pinout identik).\n  /RE+DE ter-tie = GPIO4 (RS485_DIR) HIGH=TX / LOW=RX (asumsi #1, OPEN-005R\n  verifikasi polaritas firmware).\n  R45 10k pull-up di RS485_RX (kontrak): RO idle tinggi saat line turnaround;\n  arus sink RO 3,3/10k = 0,33 mA (jauh di bawah 10 mA output drive).\n  C44 100nF pin-adjacent VCC; VCC dari +3V3 (AP2112K 300 mA shared).\nJ_RS485 = Phoenix MKDS-1,5-3 P5,08 (A/B/GND; SELV — clearance standar).\nS9: jalur A/B sejajar berpasangan, stub <25 mm, D10 <10 mm dari pin\n  terminal; kabel twisted-pair kelas fieldbus, GND pin-3 referensi kabel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 172 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b89f0d6-d657-455a-9c77-4811b02fd640")	)
	(text "FW-SYNC: UART2 remap GPIO16 TX / GPIO17 RX (tervalid GPIO-matrix);\n  driver half-duplex: set RS485_DIR HIGH >= 1 karakter-space sebelum TX,\n  turunkan setelah FIFO kosong (+margin 1 bit). Default BOM rev awal:\n  terminasi OFF, bias OFF (jumper terbuka) — commissioning memutuskan.\nSisa ERC sheet ini: label dangling S5 (PZEM_*, CAN_*) — kontrapart sheet\n  lain; U1.4/U1.5 (GPIO36/39) pin_not_driven = kontrapart J_EXP S7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 145 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd6046d2-82a8-48a6-8c67-0ebb956a379e")	)
	(text_box "07_RS485 — MAX3485 + proteksi TVS SM712 + terminasi & bias jumper (S5).\nU8 MAX3485CSA+ (SOIC-8, 3,3V): DI<-RS485_TX (GPIO16), RO->RS485_RX (GPIO17)\n  + R45 10k pull-up ke +3V3, /RE+DE->RS485_DIR (GPIO4), VCC +3V3 + C44,\n  GND->DGND (netlist proof: U8.5 & U8.8).\nJ_RS485 (A/B/GND, MKDS 5,08) -> D10 SM712 SOT-23 (A1/A2/common->DGND;\n  asimetris -7/+12 V) -> R48 120R + JP_RS485_TERM (open default).\nBias opsional R51/R52 680R + JP_RS485_BIAS_A/B (default open; aktifkan\n  kedua + terminasi: V_AB idle +0,27 V > threshold +0,2 V).\nGATE S5: TVS di J_RS485; terminasi via jumper; pull-up RO ada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 42)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1d03b0b6-dde6-4973-add2-2b9ad3c7a49e")
	)
